<title>USA: Millicom accelerates warrant exercise date.</title>
<headline>Millicom accelerates warrant exercise date.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Millicom International Cellular SA said Thursday it agreed to accelerate the exercise date of the warrants covering shares of Great Universal American Industries Inc common stock as part of the restructuring of its operations.</p>
<p>The company said the warrants will be made exercisable when an effective registration statement under the Securities Act of 1933 has been made.  The company said the warrant exercise price of $1.30 and expiration date of June 30, 1999 will remain the same. Millicom said it agreed to the acceleration at the request of Great Universal.</p>
</text>
